uri "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-process" alias AM-CDM-process version "$Revision:$ Last modified on   $Date:$".

import "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-material".

ProcessHistory (note "(Elucidation) A history is a process that is the sum of the totality of processes taking place in the spatiotemporal region occupied by the material part of a material entity [BFO].") is a class,
	described by processHistoryID (note "UID for specific processHistory.") with a single value of type string,
	described by orderedProcessStep (note "Sequence of events this object participated in.") with values of type IndexedProcessStep.

IndexedProcessStep is a class,
	described by indexStep (note "The time ordered enumeration of processes in this list.") with a single value of type int,
	described by processStep (note "The process step which corresponds to the index.") with a single value of type PlannedProcessStep.

PlannedProcessStep (note "A process that is planned.") is a class,
	described by processName (note "Human readable name which designates this process step.") with a single value of type string,
	described by processPersonnel (note "The individual who is primarily in charge of the execution of this process.") with values of type Person,
	described by processOrganization (note "The organization which performs the process step.") with a single value of type Organization,
	described by processAddress (note "Address where process was performed.") with a single value of type Address,
	described by processStartTime (note "Time when process step starts.") with a single value of type dateTime,
	described by processEndTime (note "Time when process step ends.") with a single value of type dateTime,
	described by processStepSpecification (note "Prescribed process specification for this process occurrence.") with a single value of type ProcessStepSpecification,
	described by processStepData (note "Data which describes the execution of this process including process monitoring data and real-time control information .") with a single value of type ProcessStepData,
	described by childProcessSteps (note "Sub processes that are fully contained within the PlannedProcessStep." ) with values of type IndexedPlannedProcessStep.

IndexedPlannedProcessStep is a class,
	described by indexPlannedStep (note "The time ordered enumeration that the specified processes would be performed.") with a single value of type int,
	described by processStepSpecification (note "The process specification which corresponds to the index.") with a single value of type ProcessStepSpecification.

ProcessStepSpecification (note "A prescription of how a planned process step should be performed.") is a class,
	described by specStandard (note "Standards which process should comply with, ex. AMS2774.") with values of type Document,
	described by specProcedure (note "Procedure which should be followed when the process is run.") with values of type Document,
	described by specControlPlan (note "Document that describes the methods taken to ensure the quality control of critical inputs to deliver outputs that meet requirements.") with values of type Document,
	described by specControlPlanObjective (note "information content entity that prescribes what the outcome of some process should be.") with values of type Document,
	described by childProcessStepSpecification (note "Specification for sub processes that are fully contained within the PlannedProcess step prescribed by this ProcessStepSpecification.") with values of type IndexedPlannedProcessStep.

HTProcessStepSpecification (note "A specification for a thermal heat treatment process") is a type of ProcessStepSpecification.
HIPProcessStepSpecification (note "A specification for hot isostatic pressing process") is a type of ProcessStepSpecification.

ProcessStepData is a class,
	described by dataOperatorNotes (note "Observations recorded during the execution of a process step.") with a single value of type string.

HTProcessStepData (note "Process data for thermal heat treatment process.") is a type of ProcessStepData.
HIPProcessStepData (note "Process data for hot isostatic pressing process.") is a type of ProcessStepData.

MaterialSeparation (note "A process in which one material stock is split into multiple stocks, including powder sampling scenario, but not including part extraction.") is a type of PlannedProcessStep,
	described by materialInput (note "The material stock which was split.") with a single value of type MaterialStock,
	described by materialOutput (note "The new material stocks which were split out of the original material stock.") with values of type MaterialStock.

MaterialTransfer (note "Material stock moved from one owner to another owner at a different location.") is a type of PlannedProcessStep,
	described by materialInput (note "Material that was departed from the source.") with a single value of type MaterialStock,
	described by materialOutput (note "Material that arrived at the destination.") with a single value of type MaterialStock.
